    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. i was worried blood meal might be too strong though. how exactly does the N-P-K ratio in blood meal compare to bone meal, and is there any risk of the nitrogen leaching too fast or causing a spike in salinity in that kind of soil?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
