      "content": "that makes sense. i'll try the top-dressing approach. one more thing though—since i'm doing organic, i've been trying to focus on the microbial life in the soil too. besides just the nitrogen levels, what are some other ways i can encourage a healthy soil microbiome to ensure these nutrients actually get absorbed properly by the plants?",
